<title>TURKEY: TURKEY SETS 357-DAY T-BILL AUCTION FOR TUESDAY.</title>
<headline>TURKEY SETS 357-DAY T-BILL AUCTION FOR TUESDAY.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkish central bank said the Treasury would auction on Tuesday 357-day t-bills. It had last sold 351.6 trillion lira worth of 357-day t-bills on August 5.</p>
<p>    Maturity    : August 5, 1998.</p>
<p>    Amount	: -</p>
<p>    Coupon	: -</p>
<p>Auction date: August 12, 1997</p>
<p>Value date  : August 13, 1997. -- Istanbul newsroom +90-212-275 08 75</p>
